<title>UK: KfW Unit adds C$100 million to five-year bond.</title>
<headline>KfW Unit adds C$100 million to five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion on December 13, has been increased to C$200 million from C$100 million.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    C$100	   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE *100.29    PAY DATE   10.JAN.97S</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    98.69     SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL ISSUE PRICE 100.78</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIM US/UK/CA/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
</text>
